name: sim.setStringNamedParam
description: 
luaSynopsis: int result=sim.setStringNamedParam(string paramName,string stringParam)
inputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. paramName: the key or name of the parameter
2. stringParam: the string or buffer value
3. paramLength: the size of the string or buffer value
outputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. -1 if operation was not successful. 0 if an existing parameter was replaced, 1 if the parameter was set
